/**
 * Brand marks for the agent kinds a computer may advertise.
 *
 * Paths come from @lobehub/icons-static-svg 1.95.1 (MIT), except droid (from
 * Factory's favicon, rescaled to 24×24). Maki ships only a raster icon, so its
 * 96px favicon (tontinton/maki, MIT) is bundled as a picture. Each mark belongs
 * to its owner. Letta uses its official documentation favicon; Muse uses the
 * Meta company mark (not a Muse-specific logo); see agent-marks/README.md.
 * Every mark ships inside the PWA bundle and is never loaded from
 * a remote host. A kind with no mark falls back to a monogram.
 */
